            "creation_time": "2026-02-14T11:56:06Z",
            "text": "Created attachment 3610\nPatch using attributes to keep the original version format and a regression test\n\nThis is related to the discussion about round trip of package version numbers:\nhttps://stat.ethz.ch/pipermail/r-devel/2026-January/084342.html\nThere was some interest to expand the accepted format but this patch is very minimal: only focus on keeping the original format of the numeric version.\n\nThe patch uses an attribute to handle the formatting and has a regression test too. It passes `make check-devel` locally other tests can be found only here: https://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/pull/228\n\nI haven't grepped the full CRAN and Bioconductor packages. But I searched and didn't find anything indicating the patch could break packages.",
